    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "### Sketch Lab\nWelcome to Sketch Lab our built-in visual design tool. Like Canva or Figma, it allows students to create their designs right on the platform—no extra tools needed!\n\nSketch Lab has 2 key areas:\n- **Instruction Panel** \n- **Workspace** \n\nYou create by adding elements to the workspace.\n\n*💡 Note: Because Web Lab is actively evolving, parts of this tutorial may not exactly match the latest version of the platform.*\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b5f251d0fd2e6b4547f4c02251d8bc1c-sketch Lab Panels .png",
        "key": "test-music-lab-sequences-practice-play-sequential-panel-77c61549-a2c5-4165-a211-283d47d9b82a",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Instructions Panel\nThe side bar has tabs for instructions, version history, and the backpack.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ee34065236db1554e840fd0d89991bb1-sketch Lab Panels  (8).png",
        "key": "pl_sandbox_aif_2_sketchlab_panels-b6e24a79-cc15-4655-b21f-619d07386289",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "### Tool Bar\nThe tool bar along the side of the workspace offers different ways to add to your design. \n\n## Adding Shapes \nShapes can be added by clicking on the icons in the work space. When a shape is added, drag it to the size and location you want.\n\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/504cfba502da257c77a033c2cd97399a-sketch Lab Panels  (1).png",
        "key": "test-music-lab-sequences-practice-play-sequential-panel-44ddc497-1a7a-4252-a306-a19ab550d8cf",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Formatting Shapes\nA pop-up box will appear when you click on the shape. From here, you can adjust the appearance, add text, and rotate the shape.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/499c7dc91cf29252fe5db665e83fcc7d-sketch Lab Panels  (2).png",
        "key": "test-music-lab-sequences-explore-play-sequential-overviewpanel_v2-7a8a8c6f-7428-456d-b4a8-1463a42d1f1a",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Shape Actions\nThe bottom of the formatting box has icons to duplicate a shape, bring to front, and move back.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5aa52ce25d863209615020351dd7a139-sketch Lab Panels  (3).png",
        "key": "test-music-lab-sequences-practice-play-sequential-panel-08943d00-a581-4880-acd6-de0970d8529d",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "##Text \nText boxes are added by clicking on the A. A formatting box will appear to control the appearance and rotation of the text. \n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a4e9f3d9458b742b350ca5013829673c-sketch Lab Panels  (4).png",
        "key": "test-music-lab-sequences-practice-play-sequential-panel-bf0bbc9c-45a8-4461-b394-d279f7547c56",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Arrows\nAdd arrows by selecting the arrow icon in the tool box. The pop-up box will give options to format with color, thickness, style, etc. ",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/54168ea24d3811087492471591e918a9-sketch Lab Panels  (5).png",
        "key": "test-music-lab-sequences-practice-play-sequential-panel-c846fce5-8889-4bff-8a48-f717d5302c15",
        "typing": false,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Images\nImages can be uploaded from your computer by clicking the image icon. The formatting box allows for alt text and rotation. \n\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c58d5cec584dfcf8c7474e36b929ae51-sketch Lab Panels  (6).png",
        "key": "pl_sandbox_aif_2_sketchlab_panels-ffa1e325-b3c7-48c8-b825-d0e6063ed20c",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "## Tools \nUndo, redo, and zooming tools are on the bottom right corner of sketch lab. \n\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b95a7ad40523ff36f371533919e4fafe-sketch Lab Panels  (7).png",
        "key": "pl_sandbox_aif_2_sketchlab_panels-a52624ae-6483-4c17-a46e-9d7f1bc4d6c5",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      }
    ],
    "bubble_choice_description": "Review how to use Play Sequential when creating songs",
